  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 702.15 Maximum monthly flow",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 702.15 “Maximum monthly flow” means the largest volume of flow anticipated to occur during a continuous 30-day period, expressed as a daily rate.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Wq 700) #8590, eff 3-25-06; ss by #10693, eff 10-15-14; ss by #14258, eff 7-1-25, EXPIRES: 7-1-35",
